OL,4,CPoole A&E closure: 'We need it now     
OL,5,Cmore than ever'                        
OL,6,GA hospital's emergency department that 
OL,7,Gis due to close in April is needed     
OL,8,G"more than ever", a councillor has     
OL,9,Gsaid.                                  
OL,11,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole     
OL,12,F(BCP) councillor Pete Miles wants to   
OL,13,Freopen the debate about Poole's A&E,   
OL,14,Fdescribing it as "absolute chaos"      
OL,15,Fduring a recent visit.                 
OL,17,FThe emergency department is due to     
OL,18,Fmove to Royal Bournemouth Hospital     
OL,19,F(RBH), with Poole Hospital becoming a  
OL,20,Fcentre for planned care.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
