OL,4,CNeighbour's sex assault left me        
OL,5,Cprisoner in my own home                
OL,6,GA woman who was sexually assaulted by  
OL,7,Gher neighbour has said she has become  
OL,8,G"a prisoner in her own home" after     
OL,9,Gtheir housing association, Abri,       
OL,10,Gfailed to move him as agreed.          
OL,12,FThe woman, we are calling Helen, said: 
OL,13,F"It stops me doing everything I used   
OL,14,Fto do. I used to have a social life    
OL,15,Fnow I don't. He lives so close to me   
OL,16,Fand I can't do anything about it."     
OL,18,FAbri manages more than 58,000          
OL,19,Fproperties across southern England,    
OL,20,Fincluding in Hampshire, Dorset,        
OL,21,FOxfordshire and Berkshire.             
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
